      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnt_Mills%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 1929 water filtration plant at Burnt Mills was hailed as a landmark achievement by Robert B. Morse.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnt_Mills%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "That same 1929 plant was built along the Northwest Branch Anacostia River near Silver Spring.",
