      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burnt_Mills%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A steel and concrete hollow deck Ambersen style dam was constructed across the river and still stands.",
